    ["For the whole step: about 6 crafts, 24 Coarse Blasting Powder, 12 Bronze Bar, 6 Silver Contact, 6 Wool Cloth."] = "Para o passo todo: uns 6 itens feitos, 24 Pó Explosivo Granuloso, 12 Barra de Bronze, 6 Contato de Prata, 6 Lã.",
